==Battleground==
*8 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 12~20 seconds<sup>360f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage seems very intimidating at first; the combination of Winged Pigge and Super Metal Hippoe can be deadly. Both enemies are fast and push hard, so you need to find a good combination of units that can deal with that.

Start by stalling for max wallet and money. There are 8 Metal Doges in total; you will want to kill each of them one by one before engaging the boss, as they make the boss encounter exponentially more difficult if left alive. Once you have max cash, and the Metal Doges are all dead, spawn [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] and hit the base while keeping him a good distance away. Cyberpunk Cat + [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]] will Slow the incoming enemies while [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] will hold the frontline. [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] can optionally be used as an additional layer of defense thanks to their Knockback Immunity. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] will be your star DPS for this stage, as she outranges Winged Pigge and can deal powerful DPS when stacked. You can eliminate Super Metal Hippoe quickly while stacking Cyborg Cats by timing [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]], where two solid hits will reduce him to a pile of scrap. Regardless of who dies first, once either of the two bosses falls, the cleanup will not be very difficult thanks to the lack of supporting threats.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Hayabusa]] - Though he deals lower damage than Soba Cat, he has a quite quick attack animation along with crits, if RNG is by your side, he can kill Super Metal Hippoe after Soba delivers the crit.
*[[Marauder Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Paladin Cat]] - Deals lower damage than Soba, even with crits, but attacks fast in exchange of non-guaranteed crits. Like Hayabusa, can be used as backup if Waterblast isn't leveled enough to deliver the necessary amount of damage to allow Soba to kill Super Metal Hippoe in one crit.
*[[Kintaro (Uber Rare Cat)|Kinrangers GigaForce]] - Can Curse away Winged Pigge's Weaken ability, allowing you to use lower ranged units like [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Corrupted Moneko]] or [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]] to deal with the threats.
*Ubers that knock back angel enemies - Can be used to push Winged Pigge away when Super Metal Hippoe dies before she destroys your base. (i.e: [[Springtime Kenshin (Uber Rare Cat)|Springtime Kenshin]], [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultralan Pasalan]])
*Ubers that deliver massive damage to angel enemies - Units such as [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Jizo's Moving Castle]] and [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kalisa]] can use heavy damage from safe range to push Winged Pigge away from the base and kill her much quicker.

